BAR Droid phone version of BAR's Game Type Info (luaui/widgets/gui_game_type_info.lua): the "Victory condition: ..."
line at least 7.5 % of the screen's height above its anchor (docs/upstream/bar-pregame-upright.patch, written for BAR:
upright its fixed offset left it inside the start position suggestions' tutorial, the two texts over each other).
Applied by the engine (BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as LuaUI loads it; if a block finds no place, BAR's own file
runs.

@@@ find
		messages[1].x = widgetScale * 60
@@@ with
		messages[1].x = math.max(widgetScale * 60, vsy * 0.075) -- BAR Droid (phone; docs/upstream/bar-pregame-upright.patch): clear of the start position tutorial upright
@@@ end

@@@ find
		messages[3].x = 40 * widgetScale
@@@ with
		messages[3].x = math.max(40 * widgetScale, vsy * 0.075 - 20 * widgetScale) -- BAR Droid (phone): under the first, as before
@@@ end
